# Keep text files LF everywhere (byte-identical sim output, runnable .sh)
* text=auto eol=lf
# Snapshot binaries must never be touched
*.bin binary
*.png binary
# World-bundle grids (ecosim/worlds/**). Marked explicitly, not left to git's NUL-byte guess:
# a medium grid whose codes happen to avoid 0 looks like text, and eol=lf would rewrite its bytes.
*.f32 binary
*.u8 binary
